{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49240","headline":"菩萨蛮 十三 · 温庭筠","name":"菩萨蛮 十三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"雨晴夜合玲珑日，万枝香嫋红丝拂。\n闲梦忆金堂，满庭萱草长。\n绣帘垂{罒/彔}𦌉，眉黛远山绿\n春水渡溪桥，凭阑魂欲消。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"温庭筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49240.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49240","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}